(* Why3 1.8.0 loaded this file. Goal dot4'vc was printed Valid (0.01s, 311 steps) under -P Z3,4.13.3 -P CVC5,1.1.2 -t 10.
   Predicates below are obligations a later RTL check can cite. No RTL satisfaction is claimed. *)
